{
  "file_id": "ID03520_furigana_test",
  "text_count": 205,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "During the summer of that yr,\nstrange events happened all over\nn�A~�",
      "_offset": 9261,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 43,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "The rice fields in southeast Asia\ndried up from drought, while heavy\nrains flooded the Middle East...",
      "_offset": 9333,
      "_length": 101,
      "speaker_id": 43,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "And the coldest summer on record\nhit America.",
      "_offset": 9435,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 43,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Little did seven children at\nsummer camp know...",
      "_offset": 9481,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 43,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "that this was only the beginning\nof an adventure in an unknown\nworld...",
      "_offset": 9530,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 43,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 9602,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "What's up, Sora?",
      "_offset": 9610,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Now's not the time to be sleeping.\nHelp me pitch this tent.",
      "_offset": 9627,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Ugh...Fine...",
      "_offset": 9687,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "...Brr!!",
      "_offset": 9701,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What's up?",
      "_offset": 9710,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Something's falling from the\nsky... Is that...snow?!",
      "_offset": 9721,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Don't be silly! How could it snow\nin the middle of summe--\nWhoa, that's cold!",
      "_offset": 9774,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "See, I was right! It's snowing...",
      "_offset": 9852,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "You're right...it's snowing hard!",
      "_offset": 9886,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 9920,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Koushirou! Why's it snowing in the\nmiddle of summer?",
      "_offset": 9928,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It may be another case of the\nabnormal weather we've been\nhaving.",
      "_offset": 9981,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "We'll have to wait it out...\nOh, I know!",
      "_offset": 10047,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 10088,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "I saw a small shrine while we were\non the way here. We can take\nshelter there.",
      "_offset": 10094,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Sounds good! Koushirou, let's go\ntell the others.",
      "_offset": 10173,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "All right!",
      "_offset": 10223,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "That was a huge blizzard...\nBut it looks like it's finally\nstopped.",
      "_offset": 10234,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yay! Hey, Yamato, look! It's white\nall over!",
      "_offset": 10302,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Why's it snowing in summer? Is it\nfrom all that abnormal weather\nlately?",
      "_offset": 10347,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "This is our campsite?! It looks\ntotally different!",
      "_offset": 10420,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Mimi! Don't run around, you'll\nslip and fall!",
      "_offset": 10471,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Ah...Ah...Achoo! The weather\nforecast didn't say it was going\nto snow, didn't it?",
      "_offset": 10517,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I would suggest advising everyone\nnot to stray too far from this\nplace.",
      "_offset": 10599,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "It's not working, I can't get \nonline... I thought I'd connect \nonce the winds stopped...",
      "_offset": 10671,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Jeez, Takeru...As soon as I take\nmy eyes off him, he's gone off\nsomewhere.",
      "_offset": 10761,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Brrr, it's cold...Hard to believe\nit's still summer!",
      "_offset": 10836,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Taichi! We should get back to the\nadults. They'll be worried about\nus.",
      "_offset": 10889,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Wow! It's so pretty! The fresh\nsnow looks like it's sparkling!",
      "_offset": 10960,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Yay! Snow! There's so much snow!",
      "_offset": 11023,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "What's that? Whoa!",
      "_offset": 11056,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "What a beautiful aurora! It's so\nromantic!",
      "_offset": 11075,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I've never seen one before!",
      "_offset": 11118,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "But that's strange! It makes no\nsense for an aurora to be in\nJapan!",
      "_offset": 11146,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It makes no sense for an aurora to\nbe in Japan!",
      "_offset": 11214,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Taichi! You're up! Thank goodness!",
      "_offset": 11262,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It talked! It knows my name! What\nthe heck are you?!",
      "_offset": 11297,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I'm Koromon! I've been waiting for\nyou, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 11350,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Koromon...? Waiting for me?",
      "_offset": 11398,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 11426,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "What's that supposed to mean? And\nhow do you even know my name?!",
      "_offset": 11432,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 11497,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Oh! Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 11505,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Thank goodness. I thought I was\nall alone here...",
      "_offset": 11520,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "So did I! Since you're here in one\npiece, that must mean the others\nare okay, too!",
      "_offset": 11570,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "But I'm here with you, y'know.",
      "_offset": 11653,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 107,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Aaaagh! Koushirou, what's that?!",
      "_offset": 11684,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I'm Mochimon. Nice to meet ya!",
      "_offset": 11717,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 107,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "He's been following me around ever\nsince I woke up here. I don't know\nwhat's going on.",
      "_offset": 11748,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Here?...Where are we?",
      "_offset": 11835,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "We here're on File Island!",
      "_offset": 11857,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 107,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "File Island...?",
      "_offset": 11884,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "That's right! File Island!",
      "_offset": 11900,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "That's what they're saying, but...",
      "_offset": 11927,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Hmm... Let's take a good look\nat this place.",
      "_offset": 11962,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Hey, maybe I'll be able to see\nmore from the top of that tree.",
      "_offset": 12007,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Go for it, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 12070,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Just a bit further...I'm\nalmost...there...",
      "_offset": 12089,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "There...we go!",
      "_offset": 12132,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Do you see anything, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 12147,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Hmm...Ah, there's an ocean over\nthere! But I don't remember seeing\nthose mountains...",
      "_offset": 12176,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi! Can I climb up too?",
      "_offset": 12262,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Huh? Uh...W-What's that?!",
      "_offset": 12295,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Kryaaaahhh!",
      "_offset": 12321,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 42,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Huh? A giant stag beetle?! And\nit's coming this way!",
      "_offset": 12333,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Oww...It pushed me out of the\ntree! What the heck was that?!",
      "_offset": 12386,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Oh no! That's Kuwagamon! A real\nterrible Digimon!",
      "_offset": 12447,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 107,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "He's coming this way, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 12497,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Hey, what are you doing?!",
      "_offset": 12527,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Poof!",
      "_offset": 12553,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Kryaaaah!",
      "_offset": 12559,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 38,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Bubbles...?",
      "_offset": 12569,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Taichi! We have to go, now!",
      "_offset": 12581,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 63,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Got it! Come on, Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 12609,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 12637,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Koushirou, this way!",
      "_offset": 12643,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "O-Okay!",
      "_offset": 12664,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "No matter what we do, it's gonna\nkeep chasing us! We've gotta find\nsomewhere to hide...",
      "_offset": 12672,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Here! This-a-way!",
      "_offset": 12760,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 107,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Will he be able to find us here?",
      "_offset": 12778,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Shh! It'll be fine.",
      "_offset": 12811,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "It's okay, he's gone now!",
      "_offset": 12843,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 42,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Ah!",
      "_offset": 12869,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Is anyone there?",
      "_offset": 12873,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Sora! You're okay!",
      "_offset": 12890,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "That was a close one...",
      "_offset": 12909,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Yamato! You're here, too!",
      "_offset": 12933,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Taichi! So you guys are here, too.",
      "_offset": 12959,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Wahhhhhhhh! Guys!!",
      "_offset": 12994,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 42,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Jou!...I have no idea what's going\non...",
      "_offset": 13013,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "But I'm glad everyone's okay!",
      "_offset": 13054,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Yamato! What's that thing you're\nholding?",
      "_offset": 13084,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Oh, this guy?",
      "_offset": 13126,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "I'm Tsunomon...",
      "_offset": 13140,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 163,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Why is your face all red?",
      "_offset": 13156,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "He gets embarrassed easily.",
      "_offset": 13182,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "So they all have different\npersonalities, huh?",
      "_offset": 13214,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Taichi, this weird thing is\nchasing me!",
      "_offset": 13261,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "I'm not a weird thing! I'm\nPukamon!",
      "_offset": 13301,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 51,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Ngaaahhhh! What is this thing?!",
      "_offset": 13337,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "I'm not a \"thing\", okay? I'm\nPukamon!",
      "_offset": 13369,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 51,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Seems like you two are already\ngetting in some quality bonding\ntime!",
      "_offset": 13407,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "It's been chasing me this whole\ntime, so I'm all burnt out.",
      "_offset": 13476,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Hey, Sora! Your thing looks like a\nplant.",
      "_offset": 13536,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Haha! She's called Pyocomon.",
      "_offset": 13578,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "I'm Pyocomon!",
      "_offset": 13607,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Hey, Sora, is Pyocomon a girl?",
      "_offset": 13621,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Do they even have gender in the\nfirst place?",
